# ============================================
# Docker 构建上下文裁剪 (2026-09-19, P1)
#
# 目标:
#   1. build 上下文小 (node_modules / .next / flutter_app 不进 context)
#   2. dev 产物与密钥不进镜像 (.env* / *.jks / data/)
#   3. 保留 next build + migrate 阶段必需文件:
#      src/ public/(含 public/app 编译产物) drizzle/ tools/ package.json 等
# ============================================

# 依赖 / 构建产物 (镜像内重新装/编译)
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# git / 元数据 / 工具链
.git
.github
.pi
.muse
.vscode
.idea

# env / secrets (绝不进镜像)
.env
.env.local
.env.prod
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties

# 备份 / 数据
data
/backups
*.sql.gz
*.sql.gpg

# 非构建所需 (镜像里用不到)
docs
deploy
e2e
tests
flutter_app
tools/branding
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
RELEASE_NOTES.md
PHYSICAL_OPS.md
Makefile
